# The image packages an already-built player. Everything else is context Docker would upload for
# nothing -- this repo's Library alone is tens of gigabytes.
#
# Two build-context layouts are supported, so both must be re-included:
#   local  -- docker build --build-arg SERVER_DIR=Builds/LinuxServer
#   CI     -- the release workflow downloads the build artifact and passes
#             SERVER_DIR=artifact/staging/blockiverse-server
*
!Builds/LinuxServer/BlockiverseServer
!Builds/LinuxServer/UnityPlayer.so
!Builds/LinuxServer/BlockiverseServer_Data
!artifact/staging/blockiverse-server
# Copied straight from source by the Dockerfile so the local and CI builds share one copy.
!scripts/server/blockiverse-server-admin.sh
